invariant: INV-14
file: session.h
catches: test/tx-record-builds.sh
reason: session.h stops holding a QUIC build's CH_TX_PT at 512, so a firmware
  tree that sets the value for a TRANSPORT=quic-nonblocking build compiles an
  object that seals no TLS record and ignores the setting. The Makefile and
  build.zig still refuse TX_RECORD there, so only a compile with the define
  written by hand objects.

--- old
_Static_assert(CH_TX_PT == 512, "a QUIC build seals no TLS record, so CH_TX_PT stays 512");
--- new
